<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs up $1.75-2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs up $1.75-2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.75 to $2.00 higher. Trading was moderately active. Top $55.75 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs   55.00-55.75</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs   54.50-55.25</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs   53.50-54.75</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs   52.50-53.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs   51.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00/off $1.00. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-450 lbs    44.00-44.50</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    45.50</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    47.00-49.00</p>
</text>
